    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mei Tales&quot; is a Chinese-style fantasy narrative card game. In the game, you can choose to play as one of several protagonists, seek companions, make critical choices, and embark on your own legendary journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the Great War between humans and demonkinds, the two races have coexisted peacefully for millennia. Humans built prosperous cities and lived harmoniously alongside demonkind. However, chaos suddenly erupts in Yongzhou City - a single stone that stirs a thousand waves. As plum blossoms begin to fall mysteriously, the relentless hand of fate starts manipulating events, leaving neither human nor demon untouched by the impending storm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/17589d557dc274fa7edcbbb14c4e2038.avif?t=1747834654\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huaxia - a vast world in the style of ancient China, where humans and demonkinds coexist and perceive each other. This world is full of secrets that you need to uncover. At each destination, you can choose to observe and listen, like falling petals ...... or embark on a shadowy path of theft or ambush to advance your story. Whether you choose to gain enlightenment through quiet understanding or shape your legend through cunning or cruelty, the tapestry of the land will respond to your every decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/28818c45da9f302c027b57ab4cfe3c08.poster.avif?t=1747834654\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/28818c45da9f302c027b57ab4cfe3c08.webm?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/28818c45da9f302c027b57ab4cfe3c08.mp4?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/9cafb7a2fa49347b43c49600d515433d.avif?t=1747834654\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mei Tales\uff0c</i> you can choose to play as multiple protagonists to begin your journey. Whether you seek rare treasures, forge divine weapons, brew medicines, or indulge in crafting delicacies to gift to companions encountered during your travels, these experiences will accompany you through a thousand days and nights, forming a wondrous adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the game, conspirators are plotting a cataclysmic war that threatens heaven and earth. With time running out, you must make critical choices in various scenarios to resolve the crisis. Each decision will lead the story to a different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/9123177977710b2c68c888dd0399552f.poster.avif?t=1747834654\" width=604 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/9123177977710b2c68c888dd0399552f.webm?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/9123177977710b2c68c888dd0399552f.mp4?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/117882c91a94cbeb8be02fe5064a7030.avif?t=1747834654\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>n this Eastern world where humans, demonkind, and spirit creatures coexist, you will encounter diverse characters, forge profound friendships with them, and embark on shared adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/7eedb1ac3166c1e06a45ed44e893a4d2.poster.avif?t=1747834654\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/7eedb1ac3166c1e06a45ed44e893a4d2.webm?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/7eedb1ac3166c1e06a45ed44e893a4d2.mp4?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/4bc60421ef4fb7a4f3e6d5cef41271bf.avif?t=1747834654\" data-has-big width=800 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aMei Tales\u300b offers distinct protagonists with unique backgrounds: a fallen noble, an obsessive young demon, a princess defying fate, and a lonely orphan. You can determine their destinies or recruit them as companions. Your choices and actions will ultimately decide whether they embrace humanity or demonhood in this world, with each character possessing unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, your strategic decisions and equipment combinations create advantages or disadvantages. Battle outcomes primarily depend on your divine weapons and artifacts. Accurately judging enemy attributes and equipping countermeasures will deliver varied combat experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/af120a1788ce1a00f6014162da53ba67.poster.avif?t=1747834654\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/af120a1788ce1a00f6014162da53ba67.webm?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/af120a1788ce1a00f6014162da53ba67.mp4?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/1108dbab8b965c6bc092a2b3f73b1d11.poster.avif?t=1747834654\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/1108dbab8b965c6bc092a2b3f73b1d11.webm?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/1108dbab8b965c6bc092a2b3f73b1d11.mp4?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
