es.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/af120a1788ce1a00f6014162da53ba67.poster.avif?t=1747834654\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/af120a1788ce1a00f6014162da53ba67.webm?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/af120a1788ce1a00f6014162da53ba67.mp4?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/1108dbab8b965c6bc092a2b3f73b1d11.poster.avif?t=1747834654\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/1108dbab8b965c6bc092a2b3f73b1d11.webm?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420860/extras/1108dbab8b965c6bc092a2b3f73b1d11.mp4?t=1747834654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
